<%if [field:demo[yes]] %>

This wiki contains example recipes and ingredients, each marked with a `demo: yes` field.  They show off the conventions and give you something to read while you get oriented.  When you're ready to start your own, [[Remove sample content|$:/community/recipes/ui/RemoveDemoContent]] lets you pick which categories, recipes, and ingredients to remove and which to keep.

<%else%>

This empty edition does not include any sample recipes or ingredients.  If you'd like some for reference, you can download them from [[the community editions site|https://recipes.community.example.com/sample-data.json]] and drag the file onto the wiki.

<%endif%>
